    "body": "What does `Add an iframe /i-1` mean? Is `i` here some index or is `/i-1` just an id or what?\r\n\r\nAnd last time checked, all the browsers have list of trees model for entries. They may implement it in a bit different ways.\r\nList of trees is the model I'd expect in the spec eventually.\r\n\r\nFirefox model there is to compare trees and it needs to find differing entries to load something.",
