    "body": "The reproduction steps for\r\n\r\n1. Top level `//`, contains iframe-1 `//1-a`\r\n1. Navigate iframe-1 to `//1-b`\r\n1. Add iframe-2 `//2-a`\r\n1. Navigate iframe-2 to `//2-b`\r\n\r\nare:\r\n\r\n1. Go to https://static-misc-3.glitch.me/iframe-history-weirdness/\r\n2. Navigate the iframe to \"page 2\"\r\n3. Press \"add another iframe\"\r\n4. Navigate the new iframe to \"page 2\"\r\n\r\nNow you can test moving between steps. Notably, `go(-2)` puts things in a new state (first iframe on page 1, second iframe on page 2).",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
