    "body": "The reason I'd rather stick with the model in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6315 rather than what Chrome (and Firefox-ish) does here, is the model in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6315 tries to ensure that going back twice will put you in the same history state as `go(-2)`. But that isn't what browsers are doing here.",
