    "body": "> the model in #6315 tries to ensure that going back twice will put you in the same history state as `go(-2)`. But that isn't what browsers are doing here.\r\n\r\nI would really, really like to preserve the invariant you're gesturing at. I hope we can get browsers to agree on that, even if everyone has to change!",
