    "updated_at": "2022-09-10T01:47:12Z",
    "body": "> Traversals must never create a state which the user has never seen before. They must instead traverse to some already-seen state.\r\n\r\n204 / `Content-Disposition` can create that situation, but I think that's 'ok' because it's the server's choice to have done that.",
